                        "email": "geissonator@yahoo.com",
                        "username": "geissonator"
                    },
                    "message": "This (maybe purposely) seems pretty open ended? Is it the application on the BMC that is requesting it? An external entity? Could it be an error log ID? Or is it the user (root, admin, ...)?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Control/Failover.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "hmm, for my use case it's more like host vs BMC vs user.  Maybe I need to make an enum."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Control/Failover.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 12,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "I will change to enum, maybe free form is too open ended for D-Bus."
                },
